{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1SA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"撒母耳记上","commonName":"撒母耳记上","title":"撒母耳记上","order":9,"numberOfChapters":31,"sha256":"a7c848c7dad696f5d2b54383bf4d53bd382a875e13b8cd37cc929af821b5b419","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1SA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":31,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1SA/31.json","totalNumberOfVerses":808},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["扫罗之死"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["非利士人与以色列人交战，以色列人败逃，许多人在基利波山被杀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["非利士人穷追扫罗及其众子，杀了扫罗的儿子约拿单、亚比拿达和麦基舒亚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["扫罗周围战事激烈，他被弓箭手发现后射成重伤，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就对为他拿兵器的人说：“拔出你的刀来刺死我吧，免得那些未受割礼的人来刺杀和凌辱我。”但拿兵器的人非常害怕，不敢动手，扫罗就拿起刀来，伏刀自尽了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["拿兵器的人看见扫罗已死，也伏刀自尽了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那一天，扫罗和他三个儿子，以及为他拿兵器的人和他的军队都死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["平原一带和约旦河对面的以色列人见以色列军败逃、扫罗及其众子已死，都弃城而逃。于是，非利士人占据了那些城邑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["次日，非利士人来剥阵亡者的衣物，发现扫罗和他的三个儿子横尸基利波山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["就割下扫罗的头颅，剥下他的盔甲，并派人去非利士全境，在他们偶像的庙里及民众中通告消息。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["非利士人把扫罗的盔甲放在亚斯她录神庙里，把他的尸体钉在伯·珊城墙上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["基列·雅比人听见非利士人对扫罗的所作所为，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他们所有的勇士就连夜赶到伯·珊，从墙上取下扫罗和他儿子们的尸体，运到雅比火化，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["把骨灰葬在雅比的柳树下，又为他们禁食了七天。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1SA/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2SA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1SA/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}